-SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
-SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=YOUR_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
-SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=YOUR_SERVER_SIDE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
-```
+> Results can omit documents, provisions, amendments, and transitional rules. Open the cited source and check its date and legal status before relying on it. Results are informational, not legal advice.
 
