+## Try a focused question
 
-Keep `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` on the backend/CLI only. Never expose it through Vercel client variables or `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`; the uploader rejects publishable keys.
+Start with an everyday fact pattern; users should not need to remember a citation number. For example: “I started a job at VND 12 million a month, and my employer offers 70% during a two-month probation. Is that allowed, and what should I check?” or “My workshop imports scrap as production input and has no wastewater or emissions to treat. Do I need an environmental permit?” These are example inputs, not claims that VietLex answers them correctly; a small production audit recorded one failed answer and one partial answer.
 
